_13"},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_12","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_12","text":"No, it's not.","jump":"m_ex_trony_01_20"},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_13","text":":D","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_14","text":"Thank goodness.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_15","text":"I thought I'd sent the message to the wrong person","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_16","text":"and they thought I was some kind of weirdo.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_17","text":"I've been worrying for a week straight.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_18","text":"An entire week?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_19","text":"Yeah.","jump":"m_ex_trony_01_32"},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_20","text":"(º д º ;;)","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_21","text":"I'm so sorry for bothering you!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_22","text":"Let me make it up to you! I'll send you a custom Electric Shock...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_23","text":"Trony.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_24","text":"Yes?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_25","text":"That was a joke.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_26","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_27","text":"A joke?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_28","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_28","text":"A long time passed before I receive a message from Trony.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_29","text":":(","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_30","text":"Sorry for teasing you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_31","text":"This is exhausting.","jump":"m_ex_trony_01_32"},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_32","text":"So what's going on?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_33","text":"Um...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_34","text":"Just a moment.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_35","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_35","text":"??","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_36","text":"I should have saved what I'm going to send you in my notes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_37","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_37","text":"Meanwhile, I am waiting for Trony's reply.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_38","text":"I know I may not be perfect, but I'll do my best going forward.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_39","text":"Yeah.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_40","text":"That's what I wanted to say.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_41","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_41","text":"Was it really necessary to write that down beforehand?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_42","text":"Since we're going to be working together,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_43","text":"I wanted to extend a formal greeting.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_44","text":"Greetings are crucial for building good relationships,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_45","text":"so I wrote a whole bunch of them and chose the best one.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_46","text":"I must have written at least a thousand of them.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_47","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_47","text":"That many?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_48","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_49","text":"I'm not being weird in wanting to do this,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_50","text":"am I?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_51","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_51","text":"No, not at all. I'm looking forward to working with you!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_52","text":"!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_53","text":":D","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trony_01_54","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trony_01_54","text":"For some reason, interacting with Trony puts a smile on my face.","jump":null}],"chat":true}